<h2>The name you love. A little closer.</h2>
<p>Your name, their initials, or two letters that tell your story. This custom 3D bubble letter necklace turns your chosen text into rounded, dimensional charms — a meaningful everyday piece for you or someone you love.</p>
<h3>Choose your finish</h3>
<p>Keep it polished with Gold or Silver, or add sparkle with Gold Zircon or Silver Zircon. Gallery examples show sample names and initials; your necklace is made with the text you enter.</p>
<h3>Make it yours</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Choose your finish and character range.</li>
  <li>Enter your name or letters exactly as you want them made. Count every character, including spaces and symbols — K&amp;Y is 3 characters.</li>
  <li>Check the spelling and selected range, then add to cart.</li>
</ol>
<p>Choose 1–14 characters. Your text becomes the letter design; this product does not offer engraving.</p>
<h3>Length &amp; what is included</h3>
<ul>
  <li>18-inch chain with a 2-inch extender, adjustable up to 20 inches.</li>
  <li>One necklace in your selected finish with your chosen name or letters.</li>
  <li>Gift packaging and a rose box are not included.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Care for your keepsake</h3>
<p>Wipe gently with a soft, dry cloth. Remove before showering, swimming, or applying perfume, and store separately. Read our <a href="/pages/jewelry-cleaning-care-guide">jewelry care guide</a> for more tips.</p>
